From 4f0b7bcad02b86106d33a5cddc82de6cffb16eb7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:54:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Improve divisions: dedicated pages, custom logos,
 profile-based assignment, configurable point event types

- Hide Promotions/Division Ranks nav tabs unless on Divisions tab
- Add filters to Member Profiles (sub, timezone, division, roblox rank, division rank, path)
- Add /divisions/:id page with hierarchy, members, and activity tabs
- Add logo_url field for custom division logos (URL-based)
- Move member-to-division assignment into member profile modal
- Add can_edit_point_types permission and DB-backed point_event_types table with management UI
